    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Lolit Bunda",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112632852445547072460/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJdk7yvA2Ph_nSiyXOf9hugcC3YovuIML8E2ueEePvF2jESFA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Had a great experience with Marius from Plomberie Malv Inc. I reached out on a holiday for a leaky faucet, and he answered right away. He came over, replaced both of my faucets, and even took the time to glue down my sink that wasn’t attached properly. Very professional, knowledgeable, and left everything clean. I’ll definitely call him again if I need plumbing work in the future!",
        "time": 1757688253,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Paul Darvasi",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106579679638064492891/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWeV42wj5S9jcADp7_LUnjSAggcoK9ia9RoIpeJnHoIni6n5RLFYQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "There's a very good reason that Marius and his crew have a perfect score: they are the best. He responded to me immediately and my sump pump was changed within 2 hours of my first call. His fee was low, his follow-up instructions thorough, and his demeanour professional from beginning to end. He took time to go over the bill and explain everything he'd done, and gave me several payment options. He clearly takes great pride in his work. Absolutely next level service. Honestly, save yourself the time and trouble and look no further. I won't look anywhere else for my future plumbing needs.",
        "time": 1764005859,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "k L",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102254813231305621798/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK_TxeWx5w7VG_EB7A2shMoDOqpSnLoshGC23feUyefne31GA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "I had an excellent experience with Marius from Plomberie MALV. He came to replace my old sump pump that had stopped working, and I couldn’t be happier with the service. Marius was extremely polite and professional from start to finish. He arrived right on time for the appointment and took the time to explain everything clearly — from how the new pump works to the preventative measures I can take to avoid future issues.\n\nHis workmanship was great, and I really appreciated how thorough he was. I highly recommend Marius and Plomberie MALV for anyone needing plumbing services!",
        "time": 1764736066,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Julius Lencz",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110038816532761654659/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJB7EEFb5SF1gcH0bVCn5EXcV5k9i2_VdWR80KaoIfYOqh6Fg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "I had an outdoor faucet that cracked and leaked between the walls after last winter. I received prompt courteous same day service. Once the work was completed the owner provided detailed instructions to avoid future freezing to ensure I was totally satisfied with the work. Definitely recommend using Malv for your plumbing needs.",
        "time": 1759168718,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Monika Grof",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116758222219593895731/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUQgD2VSJFcLvIfO9BuU8SK-zGAxfBxm7MW5GgHrb2RlDOditdk=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "The guys just left from my condo, they changed the kitchen faucet, installed valves. They did a great job! Thank you!",
